{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >our camp lies in ruins. Your companions are dead, and the only survivor\u2014your closest friend\u2014has been taken by monsters. Barely escaping with your life, you embark on a perilous journey to find your lost friend and uncover the truth behind the dark forces that ravaged your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive in a land overrun by skeletal hordes, goblin raiders, and ancient undead? Can you build your own shelter, forge alliances, and seal the portals that spew forth endless horrors?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda <strong>Build and expand your shelter</strong> \u2013 Gather resources, fortify your base, and prepare for the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/228f6db7f11bc7fd98ff32198acc1d23.poster.avif?t=1761347881\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/228f6db7f11bc7fd98ff32198acc1d23.webm?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/228f6db7f11bc7fd98ff32198acc1d23.mp4?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694 <strong>Explore dark dungeons</strong> \u2013 Venture into caves, ruins, catacombs, and ancient tombs filled with treasures\u2014and nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/a7ffc3969fc2c0e94f1e2dce3a602333.poster.avif?t=1761347881\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/a7ffc3969fc2c0e94f1e2dce3a602333.webm?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/a7ffc3969fc2c0e94f1e2dce3a602333.mp4?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Craft weapons and armor</strong> \u2013 Forge and upgrade powerful gear to take on increasingly deadly enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/3cfb314c04f63372881b995e44fad224.poster.avif?t=1761347881\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/3cfb314c04f63372881b995e44fad224.webm?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/3cfb314c04f63372881b995e44fad224.mp4?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Alchemy and gathering</strong> \u2013 Collect herbs and mushrooms to brew powerful potions, elixirs, and deadly poisons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/ffedd46784c5ecfca0cdd18c6baf1409.poster.avif?t=1761347881\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/ffedd46784c5ecfca0cdd18c6baf1409.webm?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/ffedd46784c5ecfca0cdd18c6baf1409.mp4?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Allies and trade</strong> \u2013 Earn the trust of dwarves and the human kingdom to gain access to valuable resources and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/e3b96966bd92425394eec21c216e77dd.poster.avif?t=1761347881\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/e3b96966bd92425394eec21c216e77dd.webm?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/e3b96966bd92425394eec21c216e77dd.mp4?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddb4 <strong>Hordes of enemies</strong> \u2013 Face relentless goblins, skeleton warriors, and terrifying undead monstrosities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/d44807f6b9772b4e7339022029026f7d.poster.avif?t=1761347881\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/d44807f6b9772b4e7339022029026f7d.webm?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/d44807f6b9772b4e7339022029026f7d.mp4?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd73 <strong>Seal the dark portals</strong> \u2013 Discover the source of the invasion and stop the spread of darkness before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/19e37c430306d827fd0c85ba81865168.poster.avif?t=1761347881\" width=862 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/19e37c430306d827fd0c85ba81865168.webm?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/extras/19e37c430306d827fd0c85ba81865168.mp4?t=1761347881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just a battle for survival\u2014it\u2019s a fight for the fate of the world. <strong>Will you dare to face the abyss?</strong> \ud83c\udf11</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420020?t=1761347881","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420020?t=1761347881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/587d456e4f2e618b19af2e3a96c841e08b98d50e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761347881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420020/587d456e4f2e618b19af2e3a96c841e08b98d50e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761347881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3958570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >our camp lies in ruins. Your companions are dead, and the only survivor\u2014your closest friend\u2014has been taken by monsters. Barely escaping with your life, you embark on a perilous journey to find your lost friend and uncover the truth behind the dark forces that ravaged your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive in a land overrun by skele